<title>USA: BRE Properties files $300 mln shelf.</title>
<headline>BRE Properties files $300 mln shelf.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>BRE Properties Inc filed Thursday with the Securities and Exchange Commission a shelf registration to sell up to $300 million in debt securities, preferred and common stock and warrants.</p>
<p>Net proceeds will be used for general corporate purposes, the company said in the filing.</p>
<p>BRE Properties, based in San Francisco, Calif., is a self-administered and self-managed real estate investment trust which owns and operates apartment communities and other income producing properties in the western United States.</p>
</text>
